@joulee 1) Send a 👋 to each teammate as they come online for the day.
2) Standup starts at :35. The 5mins before are "optional smalltalk" for us to trickle in and chat
3) Non-donut 1:1s: Once a week, we leave standup by self-sorting into 1:1 breakouts with folks we haven't seen recently

